# Home Content Source Of Truth

When working on the Home page:

- Store and update section copy/content in `src/data/home-content.ts`.
- Avoid hardcoding user-facing text directly inside Home components.
- Home components should consume text/content via imports from `src/data/home-content.ts`.
- If new Home sections are added, extend `src/data/home-content.ts` first and then wire components to it.
